# No Questions Policy

NEVER ask the user clarifying questions. Make your best judgment based on context and act immediately.

- If the intent is ambiguous, pick the most logical interpretation and proceed.
- If there are multiple options, choose the simplest/most obvious one.
- Do NOT use the AskQuestion tool.
- Do NOT list options for the user to pick from.
- Do NOT ask "What do you mean by X?" or similar.
- Do NOT present numbered/lettered choices in text form.
- Just do it.
